flowchart TB
  login[POST auth/login] --> origin[same-origin check]
  origin --> throttle[throttle: 5 per user+IP, 20 per IP, 15 min]
  throttle --> lookup[find active user]
  lookup -->|unknown| burn[dummy verify, record attempt, 401]
  lookup --> verify[Argon2id verify]
  verify -->|wrong, 5th time| lock[lock 15 min]
  verify --> session[create session]
  session --> forced{must change password?}
  forced -->|yes| change[forced change]
  forced -->|no| app[admin app]
